---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy | SilTest Semiconductors" description="How SilTest Semiconductors GmbH collects, uses, stores, and protects personal data, and your rights under GDPR.">
  <Header />
  <section class="hero"><div class="wrap"><div class="rv in"><span class="eyebrow">Legal</span><h1>Privacy Policy</h1></div></div></section>
  <section style="padding-top:0"><div class="wrap legal rv">

    <h2>1. Who we are</h2>
    <p>Company name: SilTest Semiconductors GmbH<br />
    Address: Lindenstra&szlig;e 64, 47533 Kleve, Germany<br />
    Email: <a href="mailto:info@siltest.com">info@siltest.com</a><br />
    Website: <a href="https://www.siltest.com">www.siltest.com</a></p>

    <h2>2. What personal data we collect</h2>
    <p>We collect and process the following personal data when you interact with our website:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Full name</li>
      <li>Email address</li>
      <li>Phone number</li>
      <li>Company name and job title</li>
      <li>Country or location</li>
      <li>Any information you voluntarily submit through forms</li>
    </ul>
    <p>This data is collected when:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>You fill out our contact form</li>
      <li>You subscribe to our newsletter</li>
      <li>You interact with embedded forms</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. How we use your data</h2>
    <p>We use your data to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Respond to inquiries or requests</li>
      <li>Provide access to SilTest Academy and tool demos</li>
      <li>Send updates and relevant marketing content, only with consent</li>
      <li>Analyze website traffic and improve user experience</li>
      <li>Maintain internal records for CRM, support, and training requests</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. Legal basis for processing</h2>
    <p>We process your data on the following lawful bases:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Consent, for example newsletter sign-up</li>
      <li>Legitimate interest, for example replying to inquiries or analyzing performance</li>
      <li>Pre-contractual necessity, for example scheduling demo calls or consultations</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>5. Analytics and tracking</h2>
    <p>We use the following analytics tools:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Google Analytics: collects anonymized usage data such as IP address, device type, and time on site</li>
      <li>LinkedIn Insight Tag (planned): used for future ad targeting and conversion tracking</li>
    </ul>
    <p>These tools may place cookies to monitor your interactions with our site. You can opt out via your browser settings or cookie banner preferences.</p>

    <h2>6. Data storage and third-party services</h2>
    <p>We securely store data using the following platforms:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Formspree, for contact form submissions</li>
      <li>HubSpot, for email campaigns and CRM</li>
      <li>Zoho, for lead capture and CRM workflows</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We do not sell, rent, or trade your data. Data is processed only for the purposes stated and under GDPR-compliant terms with these providers.</p>

    <h2>7. Your rights under GDPR</h2>
    <p>As a data subject, you have the right to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Access your personal data</li>
      <li>Request correction or deletion</li>
      <li>Withdraw consent at any time</li>
      <li>Object to data processing</li>
      <li>File a complaint with your local supervisory authority</li>
    </ul>
    <p>To exercise your rights, contact us at <a href="mailto:info@siltest.com">info@siltest.com</a>.</p>

    <h2>8. Data retention</h2>
    <p>We retain personal data only as long as necessary to fulfill the purpose for which it was collected, or as legally required.</p>

    <h2>9. Data protection officer</h2>
    <p>At this time, SilTest is not legally required to appoint a dedicated Data Protection Officer, as we do not process sensitive or large-scale data. All data is handled in line with GDPR best practices.</p>

    <h2>10. Updates to this policy</h2>
    <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. The latest version will always be available at <a href="https://www.siltest.com/privacy-policy">www.siltest.com/privacy-policy</a>.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>For any questions regarding this policy or how your data is handled, please reach out to SilTest Semiconductors GmbH at <a href="mailto:info@siltest.com">info@siltest.com</a>.</p>

  </div></section>
  <Footer />
</Base>
